{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-concurrency","title":"结构化并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/concurrency/structured-concurrency","wordCount":968,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"结构化并发\">结构化并发</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>结构化并发（Structured Concurrency）是 Swift 并发模型的核心设计原则（SE-0304）。它确保并发任务的生命周期受其作用域约束——子任务在父作用域结束前必须完成，取消会自动传播，资源会被正确释放。这与传统的&quot;发射即忘&quot;式并发形成鲜明对比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SC[&quot;结构化并发&quot;] --&gt; TG[&quot;TaskGroup&quot;]&#10;    SC --&gt; AL[&quot;async let&quot;]&#10;    SC --&gt; TC[&quot;任务取消&quot;]&#10;    SC --&gt; TP[&quot;任务优先级&quot;]&#10;    SC --&gt; SB[&quot;作用域绑定&quot;]&#10;    TG --&gt; DYN[&quot;动态数量子任务&quot;]&#10;    AL --&gt; STAT[&quot;静态数量子任务&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    SC[\"结构化并发\"] --&gt; TG[\"TaskGroup\"]\n    SC --&gt; AL[\"async let\"]\n    SC --&gt; TC[\"任务取消\"]\n    SC --&gt; TP[\"任务优先级\"]\n    SC --&gt; SB[\"作用域绑定\"]\n    TG --&gt; DYN[\"动态数量子任务\"]\n    AL --&gt; STAT[\"静态数量子任务\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结构化并发（SE-0304）的核心原则是：<strong>并发任务的生命周期必须受其所在作用域约束</strong>，而不是「发射即忘」。当一个作用域结束时，其中启动的所有子任务都必须已经完成或被取消，取消会自动传播、资源会被正确释放——这让并发代码像结构化控制流一样可推理。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>async let</code></strong>——并发启动<strong>编译时已知数量</strong>的异步操作，结果类型可以不同，离开作用域未等待的子任务自动取消；</li>\n<li><strong><code>TaskGroup</code></strong>——并发处理<strong>运行时动态数量</strong>的子任务，结果类型必须统一；</li>\n<li><strong>协作式取消</strong>——系统设置取消标志，任务需主动 <code>checkCancellation()</code> 或检查 <code>isCancelled</code>；</li>\n<li><strong>任务优先级</strong>——影响调度顺序，并支持优先级提升（高优先级任务等待低优先级结果时临时提升后者）；</li>\n<li><strong>作用域绑定</strong>——任一子任务抛错会取消其余子任务，等待全部结束后再向调用方传播错误。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>结构化并发把并发任务收进作用域，让取消、错误与清理都随作用域自动发生。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"async-let-静态并发\">async let：静态并发</h2><p><code>async let</code> 允许同时启动多个异步操作，然后在需要结果时等待：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func loadDashboard() async throws -&gt; Dashboard {&#10;    async let profile = fetchProfile()&#10;    async let posts = fetchRecentPosts()&#10;    async let notifications = fetchNotifications()&#10;&#10;    return try await Dashboard(&#10;        profile: profile,&#10;        posts: posts,&#10;        notifications: notifications&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadDashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Dashboard {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchRecentPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notifications </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchNotifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: profile,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        posts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: posts,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        notifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: notifications</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个网络请求<strong>并发执行</strong>，而非顺序执行。对比顺序方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 顺序执行：总时间 = T1 + T2 + T3&#10;let profile = try await fetchProfile()&#10;let posts = try await fetchRecentPosts()&#10;let notifications = try await fetchNotifications()&#10;&#10;// async let 并发：总时间 ≈ max(T1, T2, T3)&#10;async let profile = fetchProfile()&#10;async let posts = fetchRecentPosts()&#10;async let notifications = fetchNotifications()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 顺序执行：总时间 = T1 + T2 + T3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchRecentPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notifications </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchNotifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// async let 并发：总时间 ≈ max(T1, T2, T3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchRecentPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notifications </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fetchNotifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>async let</code> 创建的子任务在离开作用域时，如果尚未等待会被<strong>自动取消</strong>。这就是&quot;结构化&quot;的含义——生命周期与作用域绑定。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"taskgroup-动态并发\">TaskGroup：动态并发</h2><p>当并发任务数量在编译时未知时，使用 <code>TaskGroup</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func fetchAllImages(urls: [URL]) async throws -&gt; [UIImage] {&#10;    try await withThrowingTaskGroup(of: (Int, UIImage).self) { group in&#10;        for (index, url) in urls.enumerated() {&#10;            group.addTask {&#10;                let (data, _) = try await URLSession.shared.data(from: url)&#10;                guard let image = UIImage(data: data) else {&#10;                    throw ImageError.invalidData&#10;                }&#10;                return (index, image)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        var images = Array&lt;UIImage?&gt;(repeating: nil, count: urls.count)&#10;        for try await (index, image) in group {&#10;            images[index] = image&#10;        }&#10;        return images.compactMap { $0 }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchAllImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">urls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [URL]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [UIImage] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withThrowingTaskGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, UIImage).</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (index, url) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urls.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">enumerated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-d