s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P as 父任务&#10;    participant C1 as 子任务 1&#10;    participant C2 as 子任务 2&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C1: 启动&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C2: 启动&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: cancel()&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C1: 传播取消&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C2: 传播取消&#10;    C1-&gt;&gt;C1: checkCancellation()&#10;    C1-&gt;&gt;C1: 抛出 CancellationError&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: Task.isCancelled&#10;    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: 返回部分结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P as 父任务\n    participant C1 as 子任务 1\n    participant C2 as 子任务 2\n    P-&gt;&gt;C1: 启动\n    P-&gt;&gt;C2: 启动\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: cancel()\n    P-&gt;&gt;C1: 传播取消\n    P-&gt;&gt;C2: 传播取消\n    C1-&gt;&gt;C1: checkCancellation()\n    C1-&gt;&gt;C1: 抛出 CancellationError\n    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: Task.isCancelled\n    C2-&gt;&gt;C2: 返回部分结果</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"任务优先级\">任务优先级</h2><p>Swift 任务有优先级层级，影响调度顺序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"Task(priority: .high) {&#10;    await criticalWork()&#10;}&#10;&#10;Task(priority: .background) {&#10;    await maintenanceWork()&#10;}&#10;&#10;await withTaskGroup(of: Void.self) { group in&#10;    group.addTask(priority: .userInitiated) {&#10;        await loadVisibleContent()&#10;    }&#10;    group.addTask(priority: .utility) {&#10;        await prefetchNextPage()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .high) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki